<title>USA: Standard Management completes $17 mln acquisition.</title>
<headline>Standard Management completes $17 mln acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard Management Corp said Tuesday its Standard Life Insurance Co of Indiana unit has completed its acquisition Shelby Life Insurance Co from Delta Life and Annuity Co for $17 million in cash and stock.</p>
<p>Standard Life will add over 21,000 policies and over 900 agents to its current operations and Shelby will contribute about $105 million to Standard's total assets, taking the Company's total assets to over $600 million, the company said.</p>
<p>Standard Management shares 1/4 to $5 on Nasdaq Tuesday.</p>
<p>--Reuters Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
